Description: Unofficial Showcase build with head-up display mirroring and German.
 Showcase by Amine Rostane turns a jailbroken iPhone or iPad into a wireless
 CarPlay receiver. This build adds a Head-Up Display page in Settings >
 Display (mirroring, picture size and position for a windshield reflection),
 a CarPlay Size setting and a German translation. It replaces the official
 Showcase package. Source:
